# The Decision Engine requires no environment variables and no API keys.
#
# Every domain's data is synthetic and hand-authored (see src/domains/), and
# the decision matrix (src/engine/decisionEngine.ts) is plain, inspectable
# arithmetic — there is no LLM call and no external service in the scoring
# path. The audit trail persists to the browser's localStorage; there is no
# backend to configure.
#
# This file exists only so the submission checklist's ".env.example" box has
# something real to point at, per NOTES.md's "explicitly out of scope"
# section on why no LLM is in the scoring path.
